  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your ranks in Escape Artist in place of your base attack bonus and your Dexterity modifier in place of your Strength modifier for combat maneuver checks to grapple. Your grapple attempt does not provoke an attack of opportunity from the target.</p>\n<p>In addition, when you escape a grapple with Escape Artist and reverse the grapple, you can damage your opponent with the same action.</p>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Improved Grapple.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/body-control#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
